      "message": "It doesn\u0027t cover all the cases and I can\u0027t think of a safe way to use it automatically [1], but you could add a `FILE_COUNT` field to the index, which is new data and very small, and then use that to do a lot of index filtering up front. But for a submit requirement use case, I think this expensive path isn\u0027t very relevant. If someone finds that functionality useful, it can always be added later.\n\n[1] It can\u0027t be used automatically because you can\u0027t reliably pre-count the number of files based on the given paths since we could match the same file name in different subpaths (a case like `Makefile` modified at the top level and in subdirs).",
